! If you don't want to miss out, follow us on our social media platforms: you can find us on Discord, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube, and TikTok under the name 808GameDevStudio!In version v0.1.3, we have added controller support!Give it","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T12:46:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814446377","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4836250-1839676055894619","game_id":"steam-4836250","kind":"update","title":"Aisle of Shadows Demo - Update v0.1.2","summary":"Hello everyone!Once again, thank you so much to everyone who has played the demo so far! ❤️If you'd like to follow the developement process, you can find us on discord, instagram, youtube and tiktok. We really appreciate any feedback and wishlist, these help our small team to move forward with the progression of the full game.Changes in v0.1.2:Bug fix: The cursor now does not go to the other screen (if any) when the game is pausedNew: Discord channel link added to the main menuVery important new","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-03T12:04:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055894619","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4836250-1838407329266276","game_id":"steam-4836250","kind":"update","title":"Aisle of Shadows Demo - Update v0.1.1","summary":"Hello everyone!First of all, thank you so much to everyone who has played the demo so far! ❤️Seeing your reactions, videos, and feedback has been incredibly motivating for our small team. Every comment and bug report helps us improve the game, and we're grateful for all the support you've shown.Today we're releasing Update v0.1.1, which focuses on polishing the overall experience.Changes in v0.1.1Bug fix: When closing pause menu (Esc) while settings is open, next pressing of \"Esc\" showed setting","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T18:02:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329266276","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4836250":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:55Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:55Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4836250":"2026-10-26T14:31:55Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4836250":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:55Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:55Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:55Z"},"4909140":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:55Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:55Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:55Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4836250","app_id":4836250,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:00Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"6a611541f6e05edb6bdb1182a484d77d31263142c104f7304d76716df8ff518a","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Do not forget. It remembers more than it should. What begins as a simple task slowly unravels into something deeply unsettling. Explore the mall's deepest secrets, uncover fragments of forgotten stories, and question reality itself.","publishers":[{"name":"808GameDevStudio","creator_clan_account_id":46595789}],"developers":[{"name":"808GameDevStudio","creator_clan_account_id":46595789}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_rel